Drop your app icons in this folder before building installers:

  icon.ico   — Windows (256x256 multi-res .ico)
  icon.icns  — macOS (.icns bundle)
  icon.png   — Linux (512x512 PNG)

If these are missing, electron-builder uses a generic Electron icon.
You can generate all three from a single 1024x1024 PNG using:
  https://www.electronforge.io/guides/create-and-add-icons
or any online ico/icns converter.
